lass=\"typewriter\" data-loop data-cursor-hide=\"typing\"\n      ><span>hidden while typing</span><span>back when idle</span></span\n    ></p\n  >\n  <p class=\"m-0\"\n    >none:\n    <span class=\"typewriter\" data-loop data-cursor=\"none\"\n      ><span>no cursor at all</span><span>just the text</span></span\n    ></p\n  >\n</div>\n","individual":false},{"label":"Speed and natural rhythm","html":"<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-lg\">\n  <p class=\"m-0\"\n    >steady:\n    <span class=\"typewriter\" data-loop data-speed=\"80\" data-pause=\"1200\"\n      ><span>every key the same</span><span>tick, tick, tick</span></span\n    ></p\n  >\n  <p class=\"m-0\"\n    >natural:\n    <span class=\"typewriter\" data-loop data-variable data-speed=\"80\" data-pause=\"1200\"\n      ><span>a little uneven</span><span>like a real hand</span></span\n    ></p\n  >\n  <p class=\"m-0\"\n    >fast:\n    <span class=\"typewriter\" data-loop data-speed=\"25\" data-delete-speed=\"12\" data-pause=\"900\"\n      ><span>in a hurry</span><span>no time to waste</span></span\n    ></p\n  >\n</div>\n","individual":false},{"label":"Reserved width","html":"<p class=\"h3 m-0\" style=\"text-align: center\">\n  The\n  <span class=\"typewriter\" data-loop data-reserve data-align=\"center\">\n    <span>fastest</span>\n    <span>most accessible</span>\n    <span>smallest</span>\n  </span>\n  way to prototype.\n</p>\n","individual":false},{"label":"Pause and resume","html":"<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 items-start\">\n  <p class=\"h3 m-0\">\n    <span class=\"typewriter\" id=\"ctl\" data-loop>\n      <span>Pause me mid-word.</span>\n      <span>Then resume.</span>\n      <span>Or finish on me.</span>\n    </span>\n  </p>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\">\n    <button class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\" data-set=\"paused\">Pause</button>\n    <button class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\" data-set=\"default\">Resume</button>\n    <button class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\" data-set=\"done\">Finish on the last</button>\n    <output class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\" id=\"ctl-log\"></output>\n  </div>\n</div>\n","individual":false},{"label":"When it scrolls into view","html":"<p class=\"h3 m-0\">\n  <span class=\"typewriter\" data-trigger=\"visible\" data-start-delay=\"400\" data-cursor-hide=\"done\">\n    <span>I start when you can see me.</span>\n  </span>\n</p>\n","individual":false},{"label":"In a terminal","html":"<div class=\"mockup-code\" data-chrome=\"mac\" data-title=\"zsh\">\n  <pre\n    data-prefix=\"$\"\n  ><code><span class=\"typewriter\" data-cursor=\"block\" data-loop data-pause=\"2000\" data-speed=\"60\"><span>npm i defuss-shadcn</span><span>bun run build</span><span>bun run deploy</span></span></code></pre>\n</div>\n","individual":false}]
